<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>. </span><span id="S4.F5.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Evaluating construction time vs. recall: Fixed search settings with method-specific construction tuning for comparable Recall@10.
<sup id="S4.F5.6.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S4.F5.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:89%;">∗</span></sup><span id="S4.F5.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:89%;">On GIST1M, CAGRA is unavailable due to high memory demand; GGNN is omitted due to excessive build time.</span></span><span id="acmlabel5" class="ltx_nodisplay ltx_acm_description">Index construction time evaluation under the same search conditions compared with current state-of-the-art algorithms.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
